                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "It looks like the contents here originally came from a YAML file in I812d5805edd547c2780604119bd6ae3f969d9886.\n\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/openbmc/+/18573\n\nSeems like all earlier commits indicated this was just a \"sample\".  We really shouldn't have non-working examples checked in because they often do the wrong thing.  Therefore, merging this."
                }
